# Printers > Connect: ARCH311_REF=<rig> ARCH311_REF_INI=1 ARCH311_WININI='<as below>' sh tools/run-cp-test.sh apps/control/tests/printers-connect.w16 OUT Printers
# Same keys as arch311-ref/scn/printers-connect.scn after opening, from the same WIN.INI (the reference
# run's -WinIni values: two printers on TTY.DRV; the simulated CUPS has the same queues): Connect for
# HP_LaserJet_4, LPT2:, timeouts 30 and 60, Fast Printing Direct to Port off, OK, Esc closes.
# The CUPS queue gets parallel:/dev/lp1 (lpadmin -v, simulated); WIN.INI as real 3.11 writes it.
# regress: ARCH311_REF_INI=1 ARCH311_WININI='windows/device=HP_LaserJet_4,TTY,LPT1:;PrinterPorts/HP_LaserJet_4=TTY,LPT1:,15,45;PrinterPorts/Text_Only=TTY,FILE:,15,45;devices/HP_LaserJet_4=TTY,LPT1:;devices/Text_Only=TTY,FILE:' sh tools/run-cp-test.sh "$TEST" "$OUT" Printers
# compare: printers-connect/02.png 01-open.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# 02-connect: 3.11 shows no focus rectangle on the preselected LPT1: until a key moves the selection
# (USER's list box draws it as an XOR "caret" with an on flag, seg35:085C/08E1, and its paint only
# re-shows a caret that was on, seg35:0C4E); libw16 draws it at once. That row is left out.
# compare: printers-connect/03.png 02-connect.png active ignore 320 240 332 260 ignore 220 86 424 102
# compare: printers-connect/04.png 03-lpt2.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: printers-connect/05.png 04-changed.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# compare: printers-connect/06.png 05-back.png active ignore 320 240 332 260
# ini: WIN.INI windows DosPrint=yes
# ini: WIN.INI windows device=HP_LaserJet_4,TTY,LPT2:
# ini: WIN.INI PrinterPorts HP_LaserJet_4=TTY,LPT2:,30,60
# ini: WIN.INI PrinterPorts Text_Only=TTY,FILE:,15,45
# ini: WIN.INI devices HP_LaserJet_4=TTY,LPT2:
# ini: WIN.INI devices Text_Only=TTY,FILE:
sleep 900
shot shots/01-open.png
key tab
key tab
key tab
key tab
key space
sleep 600
shot shots/02-connect.png
key down
sleep 300
shot shots/03-lpt2.png
key tab
type 30
key tab
type 60
key tab
key space
sleep 300
shot shots/04-changed.png
key enter
sleep 600
shot shots/05-back.png
key esc
sleep 400
quit
